{
  "$comment": [
    "Your studio, as a list you can edit. `npm run studio:bootstrap` creates whatever is",
    "here and is not there yet, matching on the device code — so you can add a line and run",
    "it again without making duplicates.",
    "",
    "`template` names an entry of src/lib/templates/devices.json and fills in every socket.",
    "Leave it out and the machine is created with no ports, for you to add by hand.",
    "`check: true` marks something I could not confirm: open it and look at the back panel.",
    "",
    "Field names are the ones in gohead/model.json — --dry-run checks them before anything",
    "is created, so a typo is a message about this file rather than half a studio.",
    "Cables are deliberately not here: the patch changes weekly and belongs in the app,",
    "where the plan can check it."
  ],

  "rooms": [
    {
      "name": "Studio",
      "color": "#f2a541",
      "width_cm": 500,
      "depth_cm": 400,
      "description": "Measure it and correct the size: the map draws to scale."
    }
  ],

